<h1>You just got a ticket! 🎟️</h1>

<p>Hi {{recipientName}},</p>

<p><strong>{{senderName}}</strong> sent you a ticket to <strong>{{eventName}}</strong>. Pretty cool, right?</p>

<div style="background-color: #fafaf9; border: 2px solid #7c3aed; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin: 24px 0;">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #7c3aed;">Event Details</h3>
  <p><strong>{{eventName}}</strong></p>
  <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;">📅 {{eventDate}}</p>
  <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;">🕐 {{eventTime}}</p>
  <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #78716c;">🎫 {{ticketTier}} Tier</p>

  <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e7e5e4; margin: 16px 0;">

  <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #78716c;">You have until <strong>{{expiryDate}}</strong> to accept this ticket. After that, it's gone!</p>
</div>

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin: 24px 0;">
  <tr>
    <td width="48%" align="center" style="padding-right: 6px;">
      <a href="{{acceptLink}}" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #7c3aed; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; border: 2px solid #7c3aed; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;">
        Accept ✓
      </a>
    </td>
    <td width="48%" align="center" style="padding-left: 6px;">
      <a href="{{declineLink}}" style="display: inline-block; background-color: transparent; color: #7c3aed; padding: 10px 24px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; border: 2px solid #7c3aed; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;">
        Decline
      </a>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p style="color: #a8a29e; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 32px;">This ticket expires on {{expiryDate}}. Accept or decline by then!</p>
